description=Force your way into locked doors, windows, garage doors and vehicles with a crowbar, pick the lock quietly with a screwdriver, or cut straight through it with bolt cutters.
description=
description=Crowbar: loud but reliable forced entry. Works on locked doors, windows and garage doors, and on locked vehicle doors/hatches. Success scales with Strength, Fitness and crowbar condition. Failing damages the crowbar and risks a minor hand injury.
description=Screwdriver: quiet lockpicking. Works on locked doors and locked vehicle doors/hatches. Success scales with Nimble, Mechanics, Fitness and screwdriver condition.
description=Bolt cutters: cut the lock off any locked door or gate, or cut a hole straight through a wire-mesh or barbed-wire fence panel and salvage the wire. More reliable than a crowbar, and the loudest option of the three.
description=Every option is gated behind sandbox toggles (entry actions master switch, pry, lockpick, bolt cutters, fence cutting, vehicle doors, garage doors, reinforced doors) plus success/noise/time multipliers, so server admins can tune or disable any part of it.
description=Fully multiplayer-safe: all outcomes are resolved and validated server-side.
